{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55530","headline":"歌 五 · 契此","name":"歌 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人能弘道道分明，无量清高称道情。\n携锡若登故国路，莫愁诸处不闻声。\n（按：以上五首，《景德传灯录》原连爲一首。\n今参《宗镜录》及《明州定应大师布袋和尚传》分作五首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"契此","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}